    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1932 the Fort Worth and Denver Railway extended its line from Pampa, giving Lefors its first railroad.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7,
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lefors%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A two‑story frame courthouse costing less than $2,500 was built, and Thut erected a hotel, marking early civic growth.",
